# W4 fix (docs/gap/wave4/03-all01-opening.md): Allied mission 1's opening,
# from the main menu with NO input for 4 minutes. The four BadGuy2
# Dreadnoughts shell the Statue of Liberty from t=0 ("Mission Start" ->
# team "BG1 - Dreadnought 1" -> AttackWaypoint 0), the two Liberty Island
# Patriots (Other2) shoot missiles down, and each missile that gets through
# does the original's 300 x DMISLWH 2% = 6 damage -- the Statue stands and the
# mission keeps RUNNING. Houses: 2 = BadGuy2 (fleet), 5 = Other1 (Statue),
# 6 = Other2 (Liberty Island Patriots).
# fv-a: the Statue also takes the Patriots' own SAMWH bursts (75, special_1
# 100%) when a DMISL is shot down in its dive right over it: DamageArea
# (FUN_00489190) hits a building in the burst cell unless the burst is more
# than two levels above it. How many land there moved with the RE'd W6-04
# weapon fixes (bisected, HP at 4 min of 5117: 4297 on 7b77d57, 4722 after
# W6-04-01 Burst, 3972 after W6-04-06 OmniFire, 3852 after W6-04-22 3-D
# defence range; 3527 on fv-a), so > 4000 (DMISL hits alone) no longer
# holds. Tanya, idle
# at wp36, must still be alive: she used to follow a vanished target's stale
# approach path to the Dreadnought pier and die (LOST at f~1800).
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
click button "Single Player"
click button "New Campaign"
require scene == "shell:Campaign"
click well:allied
click button Load
until 30 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
require buildings(5,CANEWY04) == 1
require units(2,DRED) == 4
assert buildings(6,NASAM) == 2
shot o000
# DMislPauseFrames 20 + TiltFrames 60 on deck, then the climb to the map's 1550.
until 600 rockets_launched(2) > 0
shot o_first
wait 900
shot o060
assert rockets_launched(2) > 0
wait 900
shot o120
wait 900
shot o180
assert rockets_shot(2) > 0
wait 900
shot o240
# 4 minutes: missiles launched, some shot down by the Patriots, the Statue alive.
assert rockets_launched(2) >= 8
assert rockets_shot(2) > 0
assert buildings(5,CANEWY04) == 1
assert bhp(5,CANEWY04) > 3000
assert units(2,DRED) == 4
assert units(0,TANY) == 1
end expect RUNNING
